# BugBoard AI

AI-assisted bug triage tool built as an experiment in structured issue intelligence.

## Overview

BugBoard AI converts unstructured bug descriptions into structured, actionable reports using rule-based AI logic (mocked LLM-style pipeline).

It demonstrates:

- Raw text → structured record transformation
- Severity classification
- Component/environment extraction
- Suggested fix reasoning
- Confidence scoring
- REST API integration between backend and frontend

## Tech Stack

Backend:
- Java 17
- Spring Boot
- REST APIs
- JPA / H2 (in-memory DB)

Frontend:
- React
- Vite
- Custom serif + sans typography design

## Why This Project

This project explores how AI systems can assist developer workflows by:

- Reducing manual triage
- Enforcing structured issue schemas
- Generating consistent metadata
- Improving developer velocity

Designed as a lightweight AI tooling experiment inspired by modern workflow platforms.

